## Troubleshooting

If Vortex stays unhealthy and its health check reports `sonarqube-connectivity DOWN: ...
Unauthorized`, your SonarQube is missing part of sections 3, 5 or 7: check that all three are
applied and that SonarQube was restarted since. With TLS, `agentic-proxy` waits for a healthy Vortex,
so it doesn't start either until then.
